[{"client_msg_id":"a7b5d642-1758-4fcc-92ce-264c1d151e1e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"せっかく wasm-bindgen の生成ファイル読み込んだ時に `init` 関数が提供されるんだから、そこに importsObject 指定できてもいいのに。と思ったりしたけど、なんか動作が決定的じゃなくて気持ち悪いという気持ちもあって悩ましいと感じました。","ts":"1614773622.442700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10c4b883-c895-4d9e-9c73-b2d2717bc898","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"知見ですな...","ts":"1614773070.441700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYAG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46aad4fe-3a32-4217-9423-6969352293a8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"めっちゃ勉強になりました。","ts":"1614773054.441500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qCP7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7782abe1-ddf2-4fab-ab74-734123e3c595","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"ありがとうございます！本当に感謝です\nbuildは本当に面倒なので、それこそrustで書いてシュッとワンライナーで呼べる様に出来れば幸せになれそうです","ts":"1614772927.441300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25e36dfc-53ea-4216-bea7-81e832e08816","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"vim から wasm とおしゃべりしてることになるのか。これは熱い。","ts":"1614772699.438800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"28uB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3656fded-ec85-44e8-a02b-2bb2035de6e2","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"試してみてビルドがそこそこだるかったので、そこがきれいになれば有力そう。","ts":"1614772622.438000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N2ze"}]},{"client_msg_id":"232f7c2d-433f-466d-b41e-c0f487451602","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうか、.wasm ファイルならさらに速度が期待できるし、deno の勝手に DL してくるフローにも乗れるし、Rust のライブラリ使えるし、メリットが大きいのか。。。","ts":"1614772604.437500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ikupz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24d9803b-096a-445a-a1e6-a2c87088b055","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"あと、wasm-pack は便利でしたが、`--target deno` が使えないのがちょっとモニョモニョしました。","ts":"1614772533.436600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"20G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37396a48-ca41-4ed2-89c1-371af71115e6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;\n\n// When the `wee_alloc` feature is enabled, use `wee_alloc` as the global\n// allocator.\n#[cfg(feature = \"wee_alloc\")]\n#[global_allocator]\nstatic ALLOC: wee_alloc::WeeAlloc = wee_alloc::WeeAlloc::INIT;\n\n#[wasm_bindgen(module = \"\u003chttps://deno.land/std/log/mod.ts\u003e\")]\nextern \"C\" {\n    #[wasm_bindgen(js_name = log)]\n    fn log(s: \u0026amp;str);\n}\n\n#[wasm_bindgen]\npub fn greet() -\u0026gt; JsValue {\n    unsafe {\n        log(\"Hello, denops, from rust!\");\n    }\n    JsValue::from_str(\u0026amp;format!(\"{}\", \"Hello, denops-rust!\"))\n}```\nこれでいちおう `\u003chttps://deno.land/std/log/mod.ts\u003e` の log を実行するコードが吐かれました。 \u003c@U01BY3SDBRS\u003e","ts":"1614772430.436000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"puro","count":4,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","U78A6ESHM","U776661HA"]},{"name":"otokomae","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4ZHy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"669984fe-f399-49c8-9f1b-0b32599625d6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やっぱり `#[wasm_bindgen(module = '...')]` を使うのがよさそうっぽいなあ。","ts":"1614770702.434800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NXSNj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f40bfcdd-9064-4fce-8633-66f7d9b915ed","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やはり WebAssembly.instantiate の第二引数の `importsObject` に `log` などを渡したい。という話に思えているのですが、手元でビルドしても生成結果を見るに` importsObject` の中身を指定する方法がなさそう。。。","ts":"1614770060.433900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uHhun"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb453723-9743-42a7-8c0a-aa2d8561c870","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これは完全に僕が wasm に全然詳しくないため。。。というのが大きそうです。手元で試したり調べたりしてだんだん理解できてきました。","ts":"1614769996.432600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y+KHr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f32c8076-9e63-45cb-adad-e3ccb0316eb4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん、最小再現コード(できればTSだけだとOKでwasmにするとNGみたいなの)があれば、分析も捗りそう","ts":"1614769248.432100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aGEh4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37183af0-02b7-4dc3-bed3-ef30be33cdb5","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"いえ、お力になれずすみません。wasm 周りはあまり詳しくなくて悔しいですｗ","ts":"1614768796.431400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"heart","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pu2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4116392-5251-4062-8bf2-3d1de9246b67","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"このままだと皆さんの手を無限に煩わせてしまう気がするので、頂いた情報を元にもう少し詳しい所まで踏み込んで原因を探ってみたいと思います\n\u003c@U8R597E9H\u003eさん、\u003c@U776661HA\u003eさん、ありがとうございます","ts":"1614768766.431000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"puiVQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1cd47ca-50fd-4e7e-a4c9-05e7ee4c4d04","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"wasm ファイルの読み込みは普通に import して読み込んでる感じですかね？","ts":"1614767293.425600","thread_ts":"1614767293.425600","reply_count":6,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sNCIO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f2825a5-6eed-4b00-920f-4b8e9a2e70e6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これ、deno 側で定義した変数/関数を wasm 側で触りたいという話っぽいかな。","ts":"1614767230.424600","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1614767248.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ayoE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce8d7c44-8eb5-423c-bfa3-d21fd1a7bc55","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://rustwasm.github.io/wasm-bindgen/reference/attributes/on-js-imports/js_name.html\u003e","ts":"1614767101.424000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s6Kq"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"このへんでは","ts":"1614767090.423500","thread_ts":"1614767090.423500","reply_count":1,"files":[{"id":"F01PZNSKGM8","created":1614767085,"timestamp":1614767085,"name":"CleanShot 2021-03-03 at 19.24.41.png","title":"CleanShot 2021-03-03 at 19.24.41.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U776661HA","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":44624,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01PZNSKGM8/cleanshot_2021-03-03_at_19.24.41.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F01PZNSKGM8/download/cleanshot_2021-03-03_at_19.24.41.png","original_h":363,"original_w":820,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F01PZNSKGM8-c4808e7bf6/cleanshot_2021-03-03_at_19.24.41_64.png","t