":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vLflW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08cb00bb-c07e-45bf-8314-c1762a03a241","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"いや、これいきなり `js_name` だけでいいのでは","ts":"1614767050.422600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oiIBi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49ed1ecf-8175-4506-9b9c-241a90fd0dfc","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"```export function foo() {\n    console.log(\"Hello\");\n}```\nのときに\n```#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = globalThis)]\nfn foo();```\nで動きますか？","ts":"1614767000.422000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u0="}]},{"client_msg_id":"efaaa1e6-a033-4584-b1c6-01a260550ab8","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"これね","ts":"1614766876.418900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m=HO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76d455ce-8c4b-42fb-b912-e4e1223b5f4e","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"\u003chttps://rustwasm.github.io/wasm-bindgen/reference/attributes/on-js-imports/js_namespace.html\u003e","ts":"1614766873.418600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FWmH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82ae2ac3-c57a-452a-8f52-7fa467efdc10","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"そうですね、他にも`#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = global, js_name = foo)]`でdenoのscript内に直接定義した関数をいじっても同様になりました","ts":"1614766859.418100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B/MT6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cfbeefc-7656-4c3a-a6ac-d49aece55bb4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"んー違う気がしてきた。。。ちょっと自分の知識不足でちゃんと回答・議論できなそうな気がしてきました :bow:","ts":"1614766788.416400","thread_ts":"1614766788.416400","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"panda_dogeza","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zCKD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ccc0ccb-892f-4e83-956f-121058d463d1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"この場合だと `#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace = log, js_name = log]` をやったが、 `log.log` が呼べない。みたいな感じですかね。","ts":"1614766731.415000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D5W0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ee5e21e-cb91-42ec-b54b-dd3b13b7b087","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"普通にconsole.logをwasm(というか具体的にはrust)で呼び出す時に\n`#[wasm_bindgen(js_namespace =　console, js_name = log)]`\nで指定するといいんすけど同じ事をdenoでimportしたものに行うとdenopsで実行時にフリーズする(恐らくプロセスが落ちてvimのchannelとの通信待ちが終わらなくなる)といった問題に当たっています\n\u003chttps://github.com/kkiyama117/denops-rust-example/blob/main/src/wasm.rs|https://github.com/kkiyama117/denops-rust-example/blob/main/src/wasm.rs\u003e","ts":"1614766605.412600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: kkiyama117/denops-rust-example","id":1,"title":"kkiyama117/denops-rust-example","title_link":"https://github.com/kkiyama117/denops-rust-example/blob/main/src/wasm.rs","text":"Contribute to kkiyama117/denops-rust-example development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27989936?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":320,"thumb_height":320,"from_url":"https://github.com/kkiyama117/denops-rust-example/blob/main/src/wasm.rs","original_url":"https://github.com/kkiyama117/denops-rust-example/blob/main/src/wasm.rs"}],"edited":{"user":"U01BY3SDBRS","ts":"1614766693.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kCJ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b1c0491-41ad-48a5-912e-59fbc2cca7b5","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうですね。「こういう風にしたくて、こういうコードを書いたが、ここがエラーになる」みたいなサンプルコードがあるとわかりやすいかもしれません。","ts":"1614766469.409100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k8ER"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5a18188-b24e-4995-a610-a81fb2829357","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なぜ `console` の話が出てきてるのかがわからない...上記は例で実は\n\n```import * as console from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/std/log/mod.ts\u003e\";```\nとかやっているということですか？（邪推","ts":"1614766286.406500","edited":{"user":"U776661HA","ts":"1614766297.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nwnH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f912fabc-5afa-4567-94b8-6668434744c9","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"そこら辺は大丈夫なつもりです\nnamespaceの指定が `console` は出来てるのにimportした方やscriptに定義した関数は上手く行かない、といった感じです","ts":"1614766077.405400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FcWpx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c51955c9-b48c-442a-b0f2-5f3d10d4c66f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ちょっと wasm にはあまり詳しくないのであれですが、そういう import をした場合、mod.ts がたとえば「log, warn, error, info」などの識別子を提供していると仮定すると `log.log(...)` という呼び出しになります。そこは認識されていますでしょうか。","ts":"1614765846.400300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qd0TS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"130610ee-4c55-469c-870d-07a113008abd","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"というのも、console.logは走るのに他のものが走らない、みたいな事になりまして……\n分からない感じだったら諦めるんですがワンチャンスここなら……って感じです","ts":"1614765599.399300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AFUKd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"825fca31-2b58-438f-a06d-159df4ef8394","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"ありがとうございます！\nwasmで引っ張ろうと思っていたんですが\n```import * as log from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/std@0.89.0/log/mod.ts|https://deno.land/std@0.89.0/log/mod.ts\u003e\";\n```\nってやったら log っていう名前のnamespaceになる感じですかね?それともそこはランダムになっちゃいます?","ts":"1614765420.395600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6jN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"174bbeed-3435-40e0-b049-029466d6da55","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"import で手に入れた識別子はそのモジュールローカルな名前空間になります。","ts":"1614764951.393200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"heart","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kmkq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7b42082-08dc-4760-ac36-aeb3293cbd61","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"denoのimportで読み込んだ関数の名前空間ってどうなっているかわかる方いらっしゃいますか？","ts":"1614764846.392200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cFG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b39b6137-3605-43d1-b02d-f78d96635cb2","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"deno の公式マニュアルの Editor 関連ので vim-lsp-settings で deno 便利、みたいな感じのあると良いかもですね \u003chttps://deno.land/manual/getting_started/setup_your_environment#example-for-vimneovim\u003e","ts":"1614764740.390600","thread_ts":"1614764740.390600","edited":{"user":"U7TMPGWJ0","ts":"1614764751.000000"},"reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iGGEh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f75c733d-1c8a-4707-8b3b-a62193d23fb7","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"どっかのエディター方式 :blush:","ts":"1614762096.390000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking_vim","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tiQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98bf13a8-6771-42c9-b884-4d6a28b9bbc5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"どうなることやら。「開発中でAPI固まるわけねーし、自分らも固まらねーから、いっ